# Paranormal Analyst, "put a card you put into your graveyard this way into your hand": with Grafdigger's Cage out, manifest dread puts both
# looked-at cards into the graveyard (the Cage keeps the creature card from entering, CR 701.40f). In response to the Analyst's ability,
# Bot1's Scavenging Ooze exiles the Lightning Bolt: it is a new object (CR 400.7) and was not put there this way, so the only card the
# ability can put into the hand is Llanowar Elves, and it does, with nothing to choose (the ruling).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Grafdigger's Cage
Paranormal Analyst
Scavenging Ooze
Island
Twist Reality
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grafdigger's Cage.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Paranormal Analyst.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Scavenging Ooze.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Twist Reality.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Manifest dread)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | Llanowar Elves)
? Stack.Count = 1
? Bot1.Graveyard = Twist Reality; Lightning Bolt; Llanowar Elves; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Scavenging Ooze.Activate(Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Twist Reality; Llanowar Elves; Black Lotus
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Gone.Lightning Bolt)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Colors = Red
Bot1.Graveyard = Twist Reality; Black Lotus
Stack.Count = 0
